<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1027" title="View the profile of Lnyaniel">Lnyaniel</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 3<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1027"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14062#msg14062"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14062#msg14062">Hello all!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> January 31, 2005, 12:16:12 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Greetings from a new old player!<br /><br />Just found the boards this morning and decided to take a look at how people treat others on this server before making my presence known  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br />Currently I have my 21 wizzy Lnyaniel (can&#039;t get to 29 fast enough lol), my 8 Enchantress Azzdana (non twink), and my 31 SK - Kire.  I may decide to pull a cleric out of my hat or a mage - just haven&#039;t decided what yet ;)<br /><br />Let&#039;s see... about me...  My first and only character for a LONG time was on Firiona Vie - a wizardess named Lnyaniel (go fiigure).  I quit playing EQ to go and play EQ2 - I was suckered by the sales department - please forgive me!  So now I am coming back to EQ.  It just couldn&#039;t hold my interest like EQ does and it was beginning to really feel like work playing there.<br /><br />I came to Rodcet Nife because a couple of real life friends play here and invited me.  Of course I&#039;m a little twinked (nothing major and NOT my Enchantress who has just finished her newbie armor quests! woohoo!).   <br /><br />The RL friends are high levels (70 &amp; 67and different guilds) so I came here looking for a guild that would have me.  I am a little worried about finding a decent guild now though!  It seems that the only way to get into a guild here is to be 46+ level  <br /><br />Maybe someone can point me to a guild that has a great reputation that would not mind me trying out to join them? At the moment I plan on playing my wizzy as my main - but I might go the cleric route just to be able to find groups lol<br /><br />Hugs to all,<br />Lynn<br /><br /><br />PS - I wanted to add that YES I have looked at a lot of the Guilds recruitment posts - but am not having luck finding what I am looking for ;)<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: January 31, 2005, 12:19:40 pm by Lnyaniel</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
