								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14065#msg14065">Re: Hello all!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> January 31, 2005, 01:02:26 pm &#187;</span></td>
