								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14081#msg14081"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14081#msg14081">Re: Hello all!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> January 31, 2005, 05:19:24 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I wish I could say based on first hand information, but I cannot...but I think EQ pre-level 50 doesn&#039;t have much of a population.  Getting groups around level 21 is not going to be easy.  At least you have a great solo class, well, when you hit level 29 at least.  
