	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14093"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1027" title="View the profile of Lnyaniel">Lnyaniel</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 3<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1027"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14093#msg14093"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14093#msg14093">Re: Hello all!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> February 01, 2005, 10:11:59 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							LOL - beastlord...&nbsp; nice class - very nice - but not what I want to play <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Hiya Brihn! Great grouping with you on the days we spent together - I should be on tonight if you haven&#039;t gotten too far ahead of me in level with your bard!&nbsp; I&#039;m still 8th level so I still won&#039;t lose exp or have to go on a cr either - after you get us killed...&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm32.gif" alt="cwm32" border="0" /><br /><br />As far as my friends are concerned they are both in different raiding guilds and for the moment I am not interested in raiding.&nbsp; Not like a level 21 wizzy is going to be much help on a Bertox raid ;)&nbsp; Unless you want her there for amusement lol&nbsp; (getting into PoTranq would be a little difficult too)...&nbsp; <br /><br />29th level is the key though you&#039;re right.&nbsp; I can still kite in certain areas and still get a rush with it at 21 but not like 29 when (as long as I have the mana pool) I can Octal kite&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" /><br /><br />My 2 friends both just started up wizzy&#039;s too and are pl&#039;ing one to 29 so that he can pl both of ours to 29...&nbsp; then the FUN begins!&nbsp; 3 Quad kiting wizzies should be a blast!&nbsp; (Bad pun - sorry)...<br /><br />Again... thank you everyone for the replies.&nbsp; It&#039;s nice to see that a community is still existant after WoW and EQ2 took a number of players from it.&nbsp; But be heartened...&nbsp; I am an EX-EQ2 player - and more will be coming back <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiliedisco1.gif" alt="smiliedisco1" border="0" /><br /><br />Lynn<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14095"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=991" title="View the profile of Brandeewine">Brandeewine</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 15<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.brandeewine.com/IMGicon.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								HAHAHA!...I mean...That&#039;s terrible!...<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=991"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.sonsofkings.com" title="Sons of Kings" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:brandeewine16@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14095#msg14095"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14095#msg14095">Re: Hello all!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> February 01, 2005, 10:36:55 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If you&#039;re not interested in hard core raiding, Sons of Kings is a casual raiding guild (it is 46 and up though). However, we&#039;ve got tons of alts in the guild from level 1 on up. We tend to look for groups within our own guild, as the guild is based on friendship and fun. If you see someone with our tag, introduce yourself. We&#039;re always looking for new friends. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.brandeewine.com/Desktop.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.brandeewine.com/Signature.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
