								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14109#msg14109"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1396.msg14109#msg14109">Re: Hello all!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #14 on:</b> February 01, 2005, 03:37:08 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Is Nobles Reborn still around?&nbsp; I was in it when it started as Noble Alliance, but I dont know if NR is still going.&nbsp; If they are, they are a great group of people, and no real level requirement.
